: "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_28369212172730796_5258581881626541407_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CNIYYn1VTh4Q7kNvwF_tMMj&_nc_oc=AdpKIXpLHsQcoUWW-d-sSCvOnzjH03i6jywjNlcmyS9AbE6ikOmwSlGoXN7417afva8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOyZA2LE6KvSqA3UwbnsBTDlmCenvW7z7b0K2chGE7dmw&oe=6AE49D07"}, {"file_name": "store-04-source-assembly.png", "id": "1548633643226364", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1548633646559697_7297799975838773294_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4SJD_q7u8YYQ7kNvwGs1tBc&_nc_oc=Ado1WWoyE69rMNWp9HEbaOBg8MVx7S2A34ExVJH5WXWN1UbJoGTveTjw5ZHXMYESlr8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPVH4dwF5fRXTssj5MpRIJyqm8i40aPk210amldXdlUew&oe=6AE49BA0"}, {"file_name": "store-03-blue-hologram.png", "id": "1160826089604529", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_1160826092937862_5729086189951941997_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w4RhG-RDQL8Q7kNvwGhk69m&_nc_oc=AdoLbaMTGIN_4VRWDheR-zb4y9Gu_q-b2Xop0QMjdrzGf-a7B7YMvIcGYQjInON6NsQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNtofGoLSXGMN6GhsZEeLaLikruDu0yl4epqHgx3QSs5A&oe=6AE4A522"}, {"file_name": "store-06-source-joints.png", "id": "1613021433699869", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1613021437033202_467147905405238580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4018zVjpYtwQ7kNvwGMucm4&_nc_oc=AdoAMk48TFtmK6c_4WHf7wZkApAY0P63pLXGQy8UZk8T-e-rSy6AALS4miI-TSIeFtw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNTmg28FZFDeztNn34GHy3Wf7TMqg3hBJeQvoUnFg9k9g&oe=6AE493C1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer-cover.png", "id": "2160832664821064", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824665_2160832668154397_1522314912689723401_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l-9XZK9wVNQQ7kNvwGmMKUP&_nc_oc=AdqT1ab_XjS-Gk1yByHMtjWr7nqRu6jKaUpkZeDJT1OD8eR_Zza2iH12tg00K3ac4UA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOKW_zKY4vsuyxIsrp9HuBVrEqt450bKTpKYo4WJadQCg&oe=6AE4BA12"}, "display_name": "RobotAtlas", "keywords": ["Robot", "3D", "Holo", "Humanoid", "Machines"], "long_description": "Explore published robot models in 3D.\n\nRobot Atlas is an independent visualization app by Nebulytic for Meta Quest 3. Browse 71 models grouped by source company, then inspect one on a movable glass base. Resize the rack, toolbar and model to suit your space.\n\nChoose passthrough, Studio or Black. Switch between full source colour, colour hologram, blue hologram, see-through and exploded assembly views. Exploded view separates only the parts actually included in a source; it does not reveal missing geometry.\n\n70 models use exterior or simplified simulation geometry. ODRI Bolt contains a partial engineering assembly, without complete wiring, battery, camera or factory documentation. Detailed internal systems are generally absent. Published units and materials are source data, not certified real-world dimensions or finishes.\n\nThe UR5e supports six verified source-defined joints for kinematic inspection. Import your own self-contained static GLB files (up to 64 MiB and 250,000 triangles). Imports remain on your headset; skinned, animated and compressed models are unsupported.\n\nYou purchase the viewer software. Third-party models remain under their original licences, with credits in the app. Source names identify the robots; no manufacturer endorsement is implied. Internet is needed for uncached collection models.\n", "short_description": "View 71 published robot models in mixed reality or a virtual room. Rotate, resize, change visual style and separate source parts. Import your own static GLB files. Most included sources show exterior or simplified simulation geometry; detailed internals are generally absent.\n"}]}, "developer